<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ca">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; background: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
        .header { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; padding: 32px 40px; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
        .body { padding: 32px 40px; }
        .body p { line-height: 1.6; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        th { background: #f0f0f0; text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; }
        td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 14px; }
        .total-row td { font-weight: bold; border-top: 2px solid #333; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; padding: 14px 28px; background: #0070ba; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; }
        .footer { padding: 20px 40px; background: #f0f0f0; font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Casas Jewels — Comanda rebuda ✓</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        <p>Hola, <strong>{{ clientName }}</strong>!</p>
        <p>Hem rebut la teva comanda correctament. Aquí tens el resum:</p>

        <table>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Producte ID</th>
                <th>Quantitat</th>
                <th>Preu unitari</th>
                <th>Subtotal</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for line in lines %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ line.productId }}</td>
                    <td>{{ line.quantity }}</td>
                    <td>{{ line.unitPrice | number_format(2, '.', ',') }} €</td>
                    <td>{{ line.total | number_format(2, '.', ',') }} €</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            <tr class="total-row">
                <td colspan="3">Total</td>
                <td>{{ total | number_format(2, '.', ',') }} €</td>
            </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>
            <strong>Número de comanda:</strong> {{ orderId }}<br>
            <strong>Data:</strong> {{ createdAt }}<br>
            <strong>Estat:</strong> {{ status }}
        </p>

        <p>Per completar la teva compra, fes clic al botó de pagament:</p>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ paymentUrl }}">Pagar ara amb PayPal</a>

        <p style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 13px; color: #888;">
            Si no has realitzat aquesta comanda, ignora aquest correu.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Casas Jewels. Tots els drets reservats.
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
